:null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[51,65,64,70,60,59],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"13600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[51,65,64,70,60,59],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"13600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[51,65,64,70,60,59],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"13600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[51,65,64,70,60,59],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"13600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[51,65,64,70,60,59],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"13600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[51,65,64,70,60,59],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"12550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10250","city":"CS1057","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[51,65,64,70,60,59],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"12550","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020105"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"三国后期孙吴将领。凤凰元年，西陵督步阐据城降晋，引发西陵之役。陆抗闻讯后紧急调遣诸军，命左奕、吾彦、蔡贡等人昼夜兼程赶赴西陵。左奕作为陆抗麾下先锋将领之一，率部先行抵达西陵展开围城。吴军从赤谿至故市修筑严密的防御工事，对内围困叛军，对外抵御晋军援兵。陆抗将晋军各路援兵逐次击破后，吴军攻陷西陵城。","tc":"三國后期孫吳將領。鳳凰元年，西陵督步闡據城降晉，引發西陵之役。陸抗聞訊后緊急調遣諸軍，命左奕、吾彥、蔡貢等人晝夜兼程趕赴西陵。左奕作為陸抗麾下先鋒將領之一，率部先行抵達西陵展開圍城。吳軍從赤谿至故市修筑嚴密的防御工事，對內圍困叛軍，對外抵御晉軍援兵。陸抗將晉軍各路援兵逐次擊破后，吳軍攻陷西陵城。","en":"A general of Sun Wu in the late Three Kingdoms period. In the first year of Fenghuang, Bu Chan, Commander of Xiling, surrendered his stronghold to Jin, triggering the Battle of Xiling. Upon hearing the news, Lu Kang swiftly mobilized his forces, ordering Zuo Yi, Wu Yan, Cai Gong, and others to march day and night toward Xiling. As one of Lu Kang's vanguard commanders, Zuo Yi arrived first with his detachment to lay siege to the city. The Wu forces constructed formidable Defense works spanning from Chixi to Gushi, containing the rebels within while repelling Jin reinforcements from without. After Lu Kang routed the various Jin relief armies one by one, the Wu forces stormed and captured Xiling.","jp":"三国時代後期の孫呉の将。鳳凰元年、西陵督の歩闡が城に拠って晋に降伏し、西陵の戦いが勃発した。陸抗は報せを受けると直ちに諸軍を動員し、左奕、吾彦、蔡貢らに昼夜兼行で西陵へと急行させた。左奕は陸抗配下の先鋒将の一人として、部隊を率いて西陵に先着し包囲網を敷いた。呉軍は赤谿から故市にかけて厳重な防御陣地を構築し、内は反乱軍を包囲し、外は晋軍の援軍を防いだ。陸抗が晋の各援軍を逐次撃破した後、呉軍は西陵城を攻め落とした。","kr":"삼국시대 후기 손오의 장수입니다. 봉황 원년, 서릉독 보천이 성을 거점으로 진나라에 투항하며 서릉 전투가 발발했습니다. 소식을 접한 육항은 급히 여러 군대를 파견하여 좌혁, 오언, 채공 등에게 밤낮으로 길을 재촉해 서릉으로 달려가도록 명했습니다. 좌혁은 육항 휘하의 선봉 장수 중 한 사람으로서 군사를 이끌고 서릉에 먼저 도착해 포위망을 펼쳤습니다. 오군은 적계에서 고시에 이르기까지 철저한 방어 공사를 구축하여, 안으로는 반란군을 포위하고 밖으로는 진나라 원군을 막아냈습니다. 육항이 각 방면의 진나라 원군을 차례로 격파한 뒤, 오군은 서릉성을 함락했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","y